{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10640030","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10640030","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1064003001:0":{"text":"なんとか勝った……爆発魔法が効かないなんて、なんて頑丈なの……","source_cn":"总算解决了……沙虫铠甲好硬，爆炸魔法竟然都伤不到它……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x5B46363BCA87CB3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1064003002:1":{"text":"なんたってあれは、荒漠の砂王って呼ばれてる、サナスパントだからね。","source_cn":"毕竟是我们荒角沙漠的沙王——萨纳斯潘特。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x0A9AA036FAC3B51C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1064003003:1":{"text":"伝説級のモンスターだよ！","source_cn":"也算是传说级别的怪物了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x1AF09129948ED766","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1064003004:1":{"text":"カッコイイ名前だな。今後の命名の参考にさせてもらおう。","source_cn":"好厉害的名字，可以记下来当命名参考。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xB525689A1E1CFE45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1064003005:1":{"text":"……何にそんな名前をつけるんだ？","source_cn":"……什么东西才会用到这种名字啊。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4FF1ECA200EEE442","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1064003006:1":{"text":"やあ、どうも！","source_cn":"嘿，你们好！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x6CF25B43D049DD55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064003007:1":{"text":"僕はウール族のアルサ、こっちはソーンだよ！","source_cn":"我是阿尔萨，他是索恩！我们来自乌尔氏族！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x3A3775674741BDC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1064003008:1":{"text":"マーリンさんも久しぶり！この人達は、新しいお仲間さん？","source_cn":"梅林大人，好久不见！他们是你的新同伴吗？","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xA169B288CEC631ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1064003008":{"text":"マーリンさんも久しぶり！この人達は、新しいお仲間さん？","source_cn":"梅林大人，好久不见！他们是你的新同伴吗？","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xA169B288CEC631ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064003009:1":{"text":"ええ！別の次元？すごいなあ。迷宮や魔物がいるのかあ……","source_cn":"哇！另一个世界也太酷了！有迷宫和各种魔物啊……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC3BF317A9A000D91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1064003010:1":{"text":"ここには何の用で来たんだ？","source_cn":"你们怎么会来荒角沙漠？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xABE93E157D272C2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064003011:1":{"text":"太古の生き物の骨を探しに。それがあれば戻れるかもしれなくて。","source_cn":"我们来找远古生物骨骼，有了它说不定我们就能回去了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x5BA929E05933B18E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1064003012:1":{"text":"なるほど、だったら砂漠に来て正解だね！僕たち、ここで一番古い生き物の骨を知ってるんだ。ね、ソーン？","source_cn":"那你们真是来对地方啦！我们知道哪里有最古老的骨骼，对吧...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1064003013:1":{"text":"ああ、父ちゃんが言ってたな。","source_cn":"嗯，老爹提过。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x3A30A33452320430","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1064003014:1":{"text":"そういうことなら、僕は骨の所に案内するから、ソーンは――","source_cn":"既然如此，我们分头行动。我带你们去找骨骼！索恩——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x24251A47C32299BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:21:1064003014":{"text":"そういうことなら、僕は骨の所に案内するから、ソーンは――","source_cn":"既然如此，我们分头行动。我带你们去找骨骼！索恩——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x24251A47C32299BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064003015:1":{"text":"なら、一回集落に戻ってひと休みしない？サンドワームをご馳走するよ！","source_cn":"那就先跟我们回部落里休整吧，正好尝尝这个大沙虫！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xFEB9F03D07549C40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1064003016:1":{"text":"と言っても、僕たちも初めて食べるから、味は保証できないけど……","source_cn":"呃，不保证味道！因为我们也是第一次吃……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7CED5A4E81F36F9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1064003017:0":{"text":"あなたたちも初めて食べるの？てっきり、ここでは普通の食材だと……","source_cn":"你们没有吃过吗？我还以为这是这里常见的食物。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xED70AF30AAB4FF79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1064003018:1":{"text":"サンドワームは手強いからね。普段は、なるべく遭遇しないように避けてるんだけど――","source_cn":"不是啦，沙虫很难打的。一般我们都是躲着走。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7FF9468BC9608D1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1064003019:1":{"text":"どうも、ワームたちが発情期に入っちゃったみたいで……","source_cn":"但最近似乎是沙虫的求偶期……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x8270F3038493B055","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1064003020:0":{"text":"活動範囲も拡大して、気性も荒くなってるんだよ。","source_cn":"它的活动范围和脾气都变大了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4E819A1DA6D60380","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064003021:0":{"text":"だから、本当に助かったよ。君たちがいなかったら、今頃どうなってたか……","source_cn":"幸亏有你们在，不然我们肯定遭殃啦！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xAE13735E0F5278FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1064003022:0":{"text":"日差しが強くなってきた。移動しながら話そう。","source_cn":"日头越来越大了，边走边说。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xE60BD5F5514876C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:31:1064003023:1":{"text":"みんなで巨大なワームを、ウール族のオアシスまで運んだ後、センシとライオスがワームをじーっと観察し始めた。","source_cn":"你们合力将巨大的沙虫运回了乌尔氏族的绿洲。森西和莱欧斯...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1064003024:1":{"text":"不思議な生き物だなあ。砂漠に生息しているのに、海の甲殻類みたいな外殻を持っているなんて。","source_cn":"真是奇特的生物，生活在沙漠，但是外壳结构却像是甲壳类的...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1064003025:1":{"text":"ふむ、この体の構造なら、甲羅の隙間から包丁を差し込んでみるか……","source_cn":"那么，根据结构得在甲壳接缝处下刀，老夫先试试看……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x44C096E23863C40C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1064003026:1":{"text":"センシは継ぎ目に沿って巧みに刃を入れ、慎重にワームの硬い外殻を剥がしていった。","source_cn":"森西沿着接缝巧妙地切割后，慢慢剥开了沙虫坚硬的外壳。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x57B7D25C60A58833","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1064003027:1":{"text":"わ！中のお肉は白いんだね。","source_cn":"哇！里面竟然是白色的肉！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x42CABC864566A6C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1064003028:1":{"text":"それに、みずみずしくて美味しそう！","source_cn":"而且看起来好鲜嫩！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7C6434AD919BB9DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1064003029:1":{"text":"高速で移動しているからか、肉質も引き締まってるように見えるな。","source_cn":"肉质看起来也很紧实。唔，或许跟它经常高速移动有关。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF55739E9A3C65E82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1064003030:1":{"text":"はたして、どんな味がするんだろう？","source_cn":"就是不知道尝起来什么味道？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x1B71424F9AA5D7BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1064003031:1":{"text":"牛肉と鶏肉の間みたいな感じだって聞いたことがあるよ。","source_cn":"听说介于牛肉和鸡肉之间……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x00AEE61D0BAB0608","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1064003032:1":{"text":"そういうことなら、切って串焼きにしてみるか。それが一番、素材そのものの味を楽しめる。","source_cn":"既然如此，那就切块做成肉串。这样能品尝到它最原始的味道。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4C8EC30A7EE2BB9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1064003033:1":{"text":"センシ、俺にも切らせてくれ！","source_cn":"森西，我也要切！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC26827A2E4AA4A72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1064003034:1":{"text":"なら、オレは味付け用に、ソルトナッツの粉を用意してくる。","source_cn":"那我去准备点盐津仁粉，作为撒料。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xB12B8599E3C130AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1064003035:1":{"text":"僕は蛇骨草水を作ってくるよ。さっぱりしてて美味しいんだ。","source_cn":"嗯……那我去弄点蛇骨草水来，给大家解腻。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xAE491C20E0889352","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1064003036:1":{"text":"蛇骨草？それって植物なの？私も見てみたい！","source_cn":"蛇骨草，是植物吗？我有点想看看！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x48150EE255B0E089","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1064003037:1":{"text":"私とロンロンも手伝います！","source_cn":"我和满满也去帮忙！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xA339FD3ED0A42B1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1064003038:1":{"text":"え、また俺だけひとり……？","source_cn":"……怎么又只剩下我了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xACF730C93407EB14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:57:1064003038":{"text":"え、また俺だけひとり……？","source_cn":"……怎么又只剩下我了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xACF730C93407EB14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1064003039:1":{"text":"はぁ、なんかできることを探すか……","source_cn":"只能看看有没有什么力所能及的活了……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x06982B819FA26DA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:59:1064003040:1":{"text":"えっと……じゃあ、焚き火の準備でもするか。","source_cn":"唔，那我们去准备篝火吧。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC013779114FAB227","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:61:1064003041:1":{"text":"こうして、みんな一斉に準備に取りかかった。","source_cn":"就这样，大家热火朝天地忙了起来。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x62A2FBEC449DA4E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:62:1064003042:1":{"text":"あっという間に、<style=\"highlight\">ワームの串打ちソルトナッツ焼き</style>と<style=\"highlight\">荒涼の蛇骨草水</style>が完成した。","source_cn":"很快地，<style=highlight>盐津仁沙虫肉...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:62::2":{"text":"ワームの串焼きと蛇骨草水","source_cn":"盐津仁沙虫肉串与荒角蛇骨草水","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BF1920F8017E516","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:64:1064003043:0":{"text":"サンドワームを調理するのは初めてだが、まあ食べてみてくれ。","source_cn":"老夫也是第一次料理沙虫肉，各位先尝尝看吧。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4B84EE6F4FF6ACC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:66:1064003044:1":{"text":"むっ……うまい！","source_cn":"唔……好吃！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xB5186E5231521044","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:67:1064003045:1":{"text":"表面はカリッとしてて、中はしっとり。噛めば噛むほど肉汁が溢れる。牛肉よりも甘みがあって、鶏肉より柔らかい。","source_cn":"外脆里嫩，肉质紧实又多汁！越嚼越多汁。比牛肉多了一丝甜...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:70:1064003046:1":{"text":"虫が鶏肉や牛肉と同じ食感なわけないでしょう……","source_cn":"怎么想都很奇怪？虫肉怎么会像鸡肉和牛肉……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x5241D590BB4F31A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:71:1064003046":{"text":"虫が鶏肉や牛肉と同じ食感なわけないでしょう……","source_cn":"怎么想都很奇怪？虫肉怎么会像鸡肉和牛肉……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x5241D590BB4F31A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:72:1064003047:1":{"text":"やっぱり、蛇骨草水だけでいいかな。そっちは、どうしてもお腹が空いたらで……","source_cn":"……我还是先喝蛇骨草水吧。实在饿了……我再尝尝看！","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x88C40CA90AF7BF6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:74:1064003048:0":{"text":"肉は熱いうちに食った方がいい。","source_cn":"肉要趁热吃。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xD7200FF073DC78F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:75:1064003049:0":{"text":"うぅ、分かった、食べるから――","source_cn":"呜，我知道啦。我现在就吃——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x94BF7F85C75B0EEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:76:1064003050:1":{"text":"お、おいしい！とろける口当たりなのに、全然クドくない！","source_cn":"好、好吃！入口即化，但又不腻！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x95930FF7E0F8C962","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:78:1064003051:1":{"text":"焚き火を囲んで串焼きを食べるなんて……こんなに、のんびりと過ごしたのは久しぶりだな。","source_cn":"在篝火旁吃肉串……好久没有那么悠闲了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x6C21031F0F86B42B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:79:1064003052:1":{"text":"酒がほしいけど、ここの集落には子どもしかいないもんな。","source_cn":"虽说这时候应该配上一杯酒，但这个部落里都是小孩子。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC814614C2857C31A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:80:1064003053:1":{"text":"教育上よろしくないか……","source_cn":"还是不要教坏他们了……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xA7987B6F6E802871","varia